From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Halhadus <eneshakans45@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:23:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] ASoC: qcom: q6apm: add hostless voice session control

Load a bounded firmware profile containing RX/TX graph payloads and
ordered configuration, calibration, PREPARE and START commands. Retain
firmware and DMA while sessions are active or cleanup is unresolved.

Prepare private physical PCM backends through ASoC and stop both DSP
graphs before releasing clocks, codecs or calibration. Authorize backend
opens only for the controlling task. Defer UCM START until media closes
and cancel work before synchronous STOP.

Add a clocked policy PCM for audio-server probing and profile lifetime.
It discards playback and produces silence; modem samples stay in DSP.
Keep the q6apm-dai module name while linking the session helpers.

Signed-off-by: Halhadus <eneshakans45@proton.me>
